@* Profile — cover, avatar, name, stats, and recent activity. The follow button is a
   POST targeting itself (`up-target=":origin"`), so the count swaps without touching the
   rest of the card; the message button is a link to a conversation route, not a dialog,
   because a conversation is a URL worth sharing. Tabs below (posts / media / likes) are
   links to filtered views of the same profile, never a client-side index. *@

<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl">
    <Card>
        <div class="h-32 rounded-t-xl bg-muted" role="presentation"></div>
        <CardContent>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4">
                <div class="-mt-10 flex items-end gap-4">
                    <Avatar Size="lg">
                        <AvatarImage Src="https://github.com/shadcn.png" Alt="Mina Stone" />
                        <AvatarFallback>MS</AvatarFallback>
                    </Avatar>
                    <div class="pb-1">
                        <CardTitle>Mina Stone</CardTitle>
                        <CardDescription>Product designer · @@minastone</CardDescription>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex gap-2 pb-1">
                    <form method="post" action="/profile/minastone/follow" up-target=":origin">
                        <Button Type="submit" Variant="default">Follow</Button>
                    </form>
                    <Button Variant="outline" Href="/messages/minastone">Message</Button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm">Designing onboarding flows. Previously Figma, now full-time on design systems.</p>
            <div class="mt-4 flex gap-6 border-t pt-4">
                <div><p class="num text-xl font-semibold">248</p><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Posts</p></div>
                <div><p class="num text-xl font-semibold">12.4k</p><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Followers</p></div>
                <div><p class="num text-xl font-semibold">312</p><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Following</p></div>
            </div>
        </CardContent>
    </Card>

    <Card Class="mt-4">
        <CardHeader>
            <CardTitle>Recent activity</CardTitle>
        </CardHeader>
        <CardContent>
            <ItemGroup>
                <Item>
                    <ItemMedia><Avatar Size="sm"><AvatarFallback>MS</AvatarFallback></Avatar></ItemMedia>
                    <ItemContent>
                        <ItemTitle>Shipped the new paywall</ItemTitle>
                        <ItemDescription>Conversion up 8% week over week.</ItemDescription>
                    </ItemContent>
                    <ItemActions><span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">2h</span></ItemActions>
                </Item>
                <Item>
                    <ItemMedia><Avatar Size="sm"><AvatarFallback>MS</AvatarFallback></Avatar></ItemMedia>
                    <ItemContent>
                        <ItemTitle>Published empty-state guidelines</ItemTitle>
                        <ItemDescription>Design systems · 14 comments.</ItemDescription>
                    </ItemContent>
                    <ItemActions><span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">1d</span></ItemActions>
                </Item>
            </ItemGroup>
        </CardContent>
    </Card>
</div>
